      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "It feels like it would be a more graceful solution if VRChat both calculated (against their pose animation) and stored the arm ratio for each avatar during upload.\nThis takes away the need for a launch parameter option, and also does not require the user to have to go hunting down to find out what their ratio is in the first place.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
