  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-03-25T00:17:14.401Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "The newly added `--custom-arm-ratio` in build `11721` could (likely) easily be added as a custom option per avatar, similar to how OSC configs work. This would allow users to have multiple custom arm ratios, as a physically plausible arm ratio is rig dependent, and not every avatar has the same rig.",
